/* book: lead: Diathermy means heating deep tissue on purpose without cutting the skin. A short-wave unit passes a radio-frequency current through the body at 27.12 MHz. A microwave unit beams 2450 MHz energy into tissue. An ultrasonic unit sends 0.8–1 MHz sound waves through a coupling gel. The tissue absorbs the energy and becomes warm. This relieves pain, relaxes muscle spasm and speeds repair in physiotherap */
